  "key_sentences": [
    "The 2026 wet season input campaign was organised by the Union with its member cooperatives in four communes along the Dallol plains.",
    "Its aim was to place certified seed and fertiliser in the hands of producer groups before the first planting rains.",
    "Seed varieties were chosen with the regional research station for their tolerance of short rainy seasons.",
    "Table 2 lists every group served, grouped by commune, with a subtotal for each commune.",
    "Quantities are those signed for by the group treasurer at the distribution point.",
    "The Union will present the harvest results of this campaign at its general assembly in February 2027."
  ],
